# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository (task 103).
#
# The format gate (`dotnet format --verify-no-changes`) runs on ubuntu-latest while development
# happens on Windows, where core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check text files out as CRLF and make
# the two machines disagree about the same file. Pinning eol=lf is what makes .editorconfig's
# `end_of_line = lf` true on both. The index already holds LF for every tracked text file, so this
# attribute changes no content - it only stops CRLF from coming back on the next checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted, never diffed as text.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
